WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.108
To see the observations recorded in an encounter,

1.2
00:00:03.108 --> 00:00:07.165
open the patient's encounter and select the Observations tab.

2.1
00:00:07.165 --> 00:00:08.446
Read the list.

2.2
00:00:08.446 --> 00:00:14.189
Observations are grouped by date, newest first, and each entry shows its time,

2.3
00:00:14.189 --> 00:00:17.118
value and name, and who filed it.

3.1
00:00:17.118 --> 00:00:21.644
Load more observations. The tab loads 20 observations at a time,

3.2
00:00:21.644 --> 00:00:25.818
so scroll to the end of the list to load the next ones.

4.1
00:00:25.818 --> 00:00:29.826
To open the history of an observation, select its entry.

4.2
00:00:29.826 --> 00:00:35.495
The history panel shows the observation over time, as a chart and as a table.
